  "id": "./",
  "start_url": "./",
  "scope": "./",
  "description": "Snap blocks, wheels, rockets, wings, spoilers and magnets together in the garage and paint every block any colour, even rainbow. Then drive over big bumpy hills, fly off the ramp, float up on balloons (E), sail the river as a boat, honk (H) and turn on lights (L) at night, grab 4,000 coins (a magnet pulls in every coin on the map!), shop for cool parts, and race silly computer cars. Press G to save a car and V to see all your saved cars. Watch the 🎬 trailer on the menu! WASD or arrow keys drive and Space fires the rockets.",
